Dear Mr./Ms. DELA CRUZ,

 

We hope this message finds you well. We wish to remind you of your minimum payment of
850.04 for your credit card number ending in 1234 due on
   Monday, September 21, 2026. Kindly be informed that the Bank may initiate courtesy reminders before your payment due date or before your next statement cutoff thru our accredited service providers.

 

EGY Collection and Business Consultancy, Inc. (02)80000001    

Quest Marketing and Integrated Services, Inc. (02)80000001 / (02)70000001

Prime Alliance Recovery Management, Inc. (02)80000001 / (0917)1000001

 

 

If payments made have covered the minimum amount due on or before due date, please disregard this message and accept our sincere thanks.    

 

 

Yours truly,   

Cards Division

EastWest Banking Corporation

 

 

For inquiries and feedback, you may call EastWest’s 24-Hour Customer Service at (+632) 8888-1700 or email cards@eastwestbanker.com, service@eastwestbanker.com ( mailto:service@eastwestbanker.com ).

 

EastWest is regulated by the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas. https://example.com/redacted ( https://example.com/redacted )

 

NOTICE: Please be advised that pursuant to Republic Act 9510 or the Credit Information System Act, EastWest is mandated to submit your basic credit data and its succeeding updates, to the Credit Information Corporation (CIC). The said information will be compiled to help financial institutions and credit reporting agencies authorized by the CIC in evaluating the creditworthiness of prospective and existing customers.

 

Want to change how you receive these emails? You can UNSUBSCRIBE (
https://example.com/redacted ) from this list.
